# Occult bookshelf: hidden drawer search
Click plays one-shot opening, then hold final. Game spawns loot at tick 25 (0.417 s); no loot is drawn. 60 Hz timeline, 1 second total including rest. Transparent PNGs and 3x2 atlas. Native sprite pixels are not upscaled.

Six generated source cels; five unique runtime drawings because final rest reuses the open drawing to eliminate held-state drift. Upper bookshelf is locked to cel 1, preserving books and crest. Drawer extends forward-left while front plane stays parallel; empty interior remains attached to cabinet. Ground pivot and scale are approximate integration guidance, not calibrated scene measurements.

Built-in image generation, fresh creation, no generative draft edits. Sunburst2.5 is a requested prompt phrase, not a verified model identity. The requested 35.264 degree orthographic view is an artistic approximation. Small drawer-panel contour/handle variations remain across native cels. No runtime interpolation is required.

Rebuild: python rebuild.py (Pillow; ffmpeg on PATH).

Integration: Fire loot_release once when elapsed ticks cross 25; guard with persistent object looted flag. Never retrigger on held final frame. Hold the final open state indefinitely. Keep hit bounds and pivot static. Gameplay loot is spawned separately.
